/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]note_pull.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/note_pull.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-gj[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-gj/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Contract docs, copy, and NP vectors[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: write the docs-first contract for the note pull. Cover the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar row, the new capture.md section, the capture-parse and JSON [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shapes, task-dependencies §12.20/§12.21 with the NP vectors and copy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]table, the reference pages (grammar 7), and any accepted memory updates.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli note pull grammar, planner, picks, and output[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: implement the lone-header `note_pull` kind in the capture language [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and capture-parse. Build the staged planner that classifies residents, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]keys, orders, places, and writes picks; wire it into pull-in numbering, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the net pass, refusals, inbox routing, JSON, and human output; add tests[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for every NP vector.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture note-pull preview, card, and notification[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: decode `note_pull` results and render them. Covers the preview card[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the Pull In verb, the Pull-In card glyph, tint, lanes, and footer, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the calm empty state, the Shift-Return list helper, and notifications. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Includes fixtures captured from the real bob and compiled, tested Swift.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-gj","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-gj.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-gj.1"},"source_run_id":"run-2c2450c34af2b27c0157960d9f2f101f","started_at":"2026-11-03T16:59:37.200424+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"01034f983671586e995e823afe6423a275aded3a4dc0c8d42f0158a558a9ffc0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gj.1--1/chat.md","size_bytes":13762},"commits":{"digest":"e13339ffbb8464806971ddbc84ca66a6f3e8b1d339843068802b58c6882462fa","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gj.1--1/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"03180b5aabaf2b909eb812ddf43996b3a19e28e6f20001874981228858175731","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gj.1--1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":67},"meta":{"digest":"d459571a76a87af0e92602bd57cf1bae00a27720dc1bc6ba9558ca964b00cccc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gj.1--1/meta.json","size_bytes":661},"prompt":{"digest":"2c90da044721b3848ed809fc3cf3f956c99c09ca7cc8d48d0e01bac930d54348","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gj.1--1/prompt.md","size_bytes":5012},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"d395130d806cbf5ac0ca9fcdf9a810bce2d6d4e2deca06044da8c6fbd967d553","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gj.1--1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":1414},"state":{"digest":"bfbba938c4a2841e237dd62daeb85bc6ff743fd1e7de12b898b7c19ecc1a2281","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gj.1--1/